{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ff5b4d47c8b4897e3354858d13c91a63fe527c7ccccfdd18a8b02c8e1796c6c6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e104cb7cc60c5aed0d93f93ade7580a9736fc43271d591099823279e7962ce6",
      "text": "硲道夫的数学 is fun！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd72fa5384b02426eacff2fab4987ca3666308fc4992d445ffda24f150153c27",
      "text": "决定在315 Production频道做10分钟授课的道夫。\n为了引导学生们，运用新学到的年轻人文化，\n与制作人一同制作能发挥“身为偶像的自己”\n所能达成的最佳授课视频。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e104cb7cc60c5aed0d93f93ade7580a9736fc43271d591099823279e7962ce6",
      "text": "硲道夫的数学 is fun！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:648ead0e3d7b6d32b4b75dc392c7cfb491e0facdef13f877d8f1457afed01ec4",
      "text": "那么道夫先生。\n虽然昨天也提过了，我再向您重新说明一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d6b61ea8b3d5c8c707c77ca7964bed3511cc2b393ff41dd52ac17e329e4c38c",
      "text": "嗯，拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37bbe276db787b21d60df05c5baaed7edaffd3c40715d2a357a749a691b326f0",
      "text": "目前315 Production的官方频道虽然上传了各种各样的视频……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df33ce3d1e38aeabd34055c7c367f5014a0ca35d40fd3863c0c3b8e6b5062c53",
      "text": "但这次我们想制作一个能让人轻松了解各位每个人的视频。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a68d7315030bcfeed1efb7112de6af321078dae5189248bac06ea1d49970ec98",
      "text": "虽然只有10分钟这么短的时长，\n您有什么想尝试的内容吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ebb8121cd72b8c1de498cd8c99901d6b3e27f609d1358cc7d94c3b22f13f89f",
      "text": "收到联络后我构思了几个企划……\n面向学生做10分钟的授课如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fcc3cc14929ee18a6e5fd179c2384b9a2b44296e849dbfd3f2b9d174478f448",
      "text": "挺好的！不过，\n感觉需要下点功夫把它控制在10分钟以内呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:600f566943b104de2036dcb48ebe6709b1cd0ca1fd1488406bd283c05a0dcc5e",
      "text": "嗯，确实如此。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99090bb734a48b565990ac41fffc4b1687dfd314540bcd6de455cc91fb17e393",
      "text": "可以的话在今天的商谈中，\n我也想就这一点与你讨论。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba9a91bd08212267ae58a8d088de4b811cbb68cbdfa035b68c9672b5b6309f59",
      "text": "当然可以！顺便问一下，教师时代的您\n在课堂上都做过些什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bfc71feec9395bfe54d9f7655245c21ce9633ca0426b07a604f7b4c45c1ae22",
      "text": "教师时代我曾穿过玩偶服，\n也借助过舞田君的力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f84ca3386d95a879ace359817d7ebc05cd3bef3feac438cc577442d1f59b1b12",
      "text": "虽说无论哪样都是为了让人对课堂产生兴趣才做的，\n但并没能收获多少成效……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc70fcbe3f17f6501a70fe7137ecb6d010e050b7cc0b124d354dbeb38efed3a3",
      "text": "不过，我认为那种奇思妙想非常棒。\n在这次的视频里，也好好活用那份经验吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e094a532e1c931cbab412738044defd771e4242befd3d739a3663012d863a14",
      "text": "是啊。不过，稍微改变一下切入点\n或许会更好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1846453abae1afe1248402cff9dfef8153a8a954e39eca7dbe7298f111071ce8",
      "text": "实际的课堂和授课视频之间，应该会有很多不同之处。\n况且，现在的我是偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f173765ceb073c10a2da5fb03debce3bdcf3b5e033093e4294c86092b0ddc77c",
      "text": "确实如此。作为偶像，\n一定会有全新的切入点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1335d13b0a2a3aed4f53ce6ad123af2b1e30c4aa97468921ca66353234ee5ee",
      "text": "比如打个比方……讲解S.E.M歌曲中出现的数学术语怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb56084327419d3b942079372e3e548b0c9f975eba28f55bb7bbaf1b48c222c5",
      "text": "原来如此。比起讲解完全陌生的术语，\n讲解歌词更能吸引兴趣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e664ea4aa6c22165b6b6e86eaed1e4372df1169ddf26d3acc809cbf755ecd39",
      "text": "也就是说，观众是出于“主动想要了解”的情感\n来观看视频的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76a44686640ede090d199cf76e2af852e268b62d85e0893a0484f85b13401371",
      "text": "这样学到的知识，肯定比被他人强迫更能掌握牢固。\n……嗯。切入点很不错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54594cf7baeac17e7824f33977f82076cebf77c6d08db5b1913bf59e1fabc678",
      "text": "那么，我这就从歌词中提取术语，撰写脚本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:163fd1b1241c2ac93e427fcdaff0566ee184f81cf76ad6b45b7f67aee91fde36",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。关于前几天拍摄的视频，\n在这次的商谈中我想就剪辑也进行一些讨论。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d00c0e4e7f3197ca4b73bee0e13b0996d93b657d509536fd1d3e1b1f57ee05f",
      "text": "听说了视频之事的妹妹，\n建议我在剪辑上也下点功夫。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43b70f06969b9cd53e1cf2f12926218d03b4d1ffebf47a35afe99defe2e18112",
      "text": "为此，我去研究了网络上\n补习班讲师上传的视频。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa0d28d0ba128b2af2d391ae341e380fb521285144bd8a9054466b576fead415",
      "text": "若要实行这些诀窍，势必会对剪辑提出相当多的要求。\n不知道是否有问题？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87ad8964198ab61fb0f749f31cbd733a159794521501d4fa9572868b734ae40d",
      "text": "当然没问题！为了传达道夫先生的心意，\n我们就精益求精，直到满意为止吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdef5764eb619f25b4a62c515321826653ebde3f7793629da01ee2bc5586bb53",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。\n那么，我准备了资料，请过目。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41870d552dbe5b4e296c0e234eed3fb3c5b708ee4ccff2700f2896cba93cad3e",
      "text": "这是关于引人注目的封面图和画面构成的资料，\n以及以此为基础试做的图片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff12424010a8cae86ae0bd04696c2193d7a1eee39673950f99246f3d9f0e5f2e",
      "text": "真不愧是道夫先生，这份资料非常一目了然呢。\n而且，这封面确实非常吸睛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c092510b7f409ee11b93bc7b468794f46edfbff749a15668bb0012c71e682a6d",
      "text": "不过，字体全用明朝体的话，\n可能稍微会给人一种生硬的印象……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf9b6ecb2a9a87fc3a5900f70cd6c283da826d4ddc9b10dd2b91c1323022810b",
      "text": "原来如此……倒并非刻意选择，\n但确实可能偏离了年轻人的喜好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c541779f5636df5bf22ea9c3d868188dcfa0facef33f434d96af1689baba94fd",
      "text": "我去查阅一下面向青少年的视频和杂志，\n寻找最合适的字体吧。那么，接下来是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17fb9fc84ebf29c970b47165f45f49e7369dce0b132d19aab756bef8d4b1636f",
      "text": "接下来就是视频的标题了！\n您有什么想法吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2536d4ce90eb9a7508ab9ca25f00327a80f8076b64d73d7ac0f8bf65061aaf69",
      "text": "嗯。关于那个我已经想好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0a4141cb1d39fad50bd0ed4922e9f31c8c8d6e3212645acea839b283bdf7e9f",
      "text": "叫《硲道夫的SIF！》。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a7f846d023a0c87e95575c17f16adfc9ac1cec5cc1a35b1ca32eb6e866f43b6",
      "text": "“SIF”……\n这是取了什么的首字母吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:377f557eadf26038f0103987a1c0ae1d0bd4fba54851d6c71c80fb6cac7baeac",
      "text": "是数学 is fun。这样一来光看标题，\n应该就能让人感受到数学是一件有趣的事了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e56f0459189b1ea31293365ac23218793fa83449eee4331cd434934cb6c4554b",
      "text": "真不错！为了方便在社交网络上分享，\n把它做成话题标签怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a9a0a5c97b5f12bff57709cf95616b1a903c7ade3c4cd180117a0b34049130b",
      "text": "话题标签。有了那个，带相同标签的人\n之间就更容易找到彼此……好提案。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2948596754e952ba18f161606c075df4f6b9c99f91e00574079b9f5ea161e41d",
      "text": "……总结一下，\n视频的标题就定这个了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:722a1a29c1c859fba1bfb52512e05f1bec8220dcb1625bd9ea6c715d71372732",
      "text": "【#SIF】硲道夫的SIF！【315ch】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6e6df1a95f0833de7c94b6fc9efc1acd6a5296754b1466e7c93702343317204",
      "text": "喔……！变成了一个很棒的标题呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8355b8fde179d226feed51fd58bf9af4441d28db57f4d8b87daf577ba5f1c8be",
      "text": "是啊。多亏了你，显得时髦多了。\n这样一来，想必年轻人也能产生兴趣吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc24f1010703f9865c561eecf995a3d8200e061165077f50a76877ed81ec47fd",
      "text": "视频公开数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_e:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc30f0ee0aa4ce2086cda4f370fb8478acf63b863b5ad19cad7c7ae88124d86b",
      "text": "前几天公开的道夫先生的视频，\n好评和评论每天都在增加呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32294d7fe3e274385b9386f2858414c800b675304c9eab43a10d6d13ee332ee8",
      "text": "是啊。特别是来自学生的留言很多。\n我马上把今天收到的评论读一读吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae6c35e03dd9f4f1acaaf29d1564d307f0445cb4b39fe6503036543bc146d023",
      "text": "“原本对数学挺抵触的，\n但多亏了这个视频稍微有点克服了！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f581378c6dc96c684a962b3d12f61e63143f8751682625d745bdc3d19dbf5b54",
      "text": "“在这个视频里看到的数学术语在考试里考到了，\n考了个好分数！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7a7fe2fb1cfe133234e7d2a17c0d53d442803c6c5cc031bd6f973cd96dc6587",
      "text": "……此外还有许多对数学抱有好感的反馈。\n真是令人欣喜的成果。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6fced6b0e538ff5593557f312289c5b3a69a4926b575b55daa9f76af0720276",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。正因为有你的协助，\n才能让他们萌生出对学习的积极性。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c45213576886928343180c83f519e9ba8869962d77b5763294e215e5ee05de",
      "text": "而且这次制作视频，\n对我来说也是一次宝贵的经验。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0ac10d733852b156ace17791d8c33486996f281e55446240dffc995c5891998",
      "text": "虽然门外汉的我有很多不明白的地方，但始于“未知”，\n托福让我学到了很多东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c036adb433e8011b05fd6ea8c5d6acc74fbec3a6b1943c03effce0e29d6887e",
      "text": "关于偶像，我尚且还有很多一无所知的事……\n但今后也希望能借用你的力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd497104e8d1f9d1581cbe22c2c6c923aa7e89e15052296d6627030abc19d7e0",
      "text": "收获颇多的学习，对我而言亦是喜悦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_01_1_2_035_01:1_2_035_01_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19aa94e2c4bd38023bcd303365d58a703b2a72ad0358d5106ab093d865ad106d",
      "text": "道夫先生……！嗯，那是当然的。\n让我们一起去学习更多的事物吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
